&lt;h3&gt;Other Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Added new overloads for &lt;code&gt;UploadAsync&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;Upload&lt;/code&gt;, enabling callers to upload logs in &lt;code&gt;BinaryData&lt;/code&gt; form.  This allows for callers to use an AOT-compliant serializer for logs, ensuring the Ingestion package can be trimmed.&lt;/li&gt;
